        {
          "title": "泄洪井",
          "content": "<p>英国 Ladybower 水库非常奇特。水库大坝的泄洪孔，不是开在大坝上，而是坝身两侧的两个垂直的泄洪井。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012001.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>平时，水库的水位低，两个泄洪井都是空的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012003.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012004.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>一旦遇到洪水期，水库的水位上涨，超过了泄洪井的围栏，水就会从井里垂直下泄。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012005.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012006.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>远远看去，好像水中两个巨大的天坑，非常壮观，成为当地的一道著名景观。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012007.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "泄洪井",
              "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news/uk-england-derbyshire-59966942"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012001.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012003.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012004.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012005.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012006.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202201/bg2022012007.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "燃烧的铁轨",
          "content": "<p>美国芝加哥火车站，冬季严寒，铁轨会结冰。这对火车行驶很不安全。</p>\n<p>为了除冰，铁路公司在铁轨上装了燃气管道。一旦有列车通过，就会自动打开燃气喷头，并且点燃。火车就会在火焰中前进（<a href=\"https://twitter.com/SorenSpicknall/status/1485701188955914242\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">现场视频</a>）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022020605.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022020607.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022020606.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
